AI Orchestration Specification
Infrastructure Copilot v1.0

1. Business Perspective
The AI Orchestration layer is the decision engine of Infrastructure Copilot. It converts a user’s operational question into a controlled workflow across identity, permissions, retrieval, tools, model selection, validation, citations, audit logging, and cost tracking.
The Infra Copilot-PRD defines Infrastructure Copilot as a multi-tenant AI-powered Infrastructure Intelligence Platform designed to reduce MTTR using retrieval, incident correlation, historical pattern matching, change analysis, knowledge retrieval, and guided troubleshooting. [Infra Copilot-PRD | Outlook]
